      "solution": "Nhà đầu tư nhỏ (Bảng 1): Cỡ mẫu <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br/>Số trung bình của mẫu số liệu ghép nhóm là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">¯</mo></mover><mi>1</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>35</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>55</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>65</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>75</mn></mrow><mn>24</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br/>Phương sai của mẫu số liệu ghép nhóm là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>1</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>50</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>35</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>50</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>50</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>55</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>50</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>65</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>50</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>75</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>50</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>24</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>725</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mrow><mn>241</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>67</mn></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br/>Độ lệch chuẩn của mẫu số liệu ghép nhóm là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>1</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>725</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></msqrt><mo>≈</mo><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>55</mn></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br/>Nhà đầu tư lớn (Bảng 2): Cỡ mẫu <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br/>Số trung bình của mẫu số liệu ghép nhóm là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">¯</mo></mover><mi>2</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>125</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>135</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>145</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>155</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>165</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>175</mn></mrow><mn>24</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>150</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br/>Phương sai của mẫu số liệu ghép nhóm là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>2</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>125</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>150</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>135</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>150</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>145</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>150</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>155</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>150</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>165</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>150</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>175</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>150</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>24</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>425</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mrow><mn>141</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>67</mn></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br/>Độ lệch chuẩn của mẫu số liệu ghép nhóm là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>2</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>425</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></msqrt><mo>≈</mo><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br/>Vậy <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>725</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></msqrt><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>425</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></msqrt><mo>≈</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>64</mn></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.",
